 \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAuto on docking (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mmanifest.travel connects a ship as it docks if a slot is free, and disconnects it as its pad lets go. Provisioning \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mspawns connected. A ship docked with no free slot keeps using its own supplies, and is connected when a slot frees.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[39m Explicit command\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA player command Connect(ship) asks for a slot while docked; Disconnect or departure releases it. More control, one\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mmore step\u001b[16Gper\u001b[20Gdock.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  4.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0003 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[16;1H"]
