[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[10B←  ☒ Connection \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Resupply \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWhere\u001b[9G oxygen r\u001b[19Gfills and replacem\u001b[38Gnt cartridges come from?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mFrom the hold (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe player buys ItemOxygen / cartridges through the book, loads them into the hold, then a command moves them into \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bthe tanks or the scrubber.\u001b[33GT\u001b[35Ge price is the\u001b[50Gmarket's;\u001b[60Gno\u001b[63Gnew pricing rule. Works anywhere, since the hold \u001b[114G \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153maboard.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BStat\u001b[11Gon service sale\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mcommand buys a\u001b[23Grefill or cartridge direct\u001b[50Gy from the docked station at a\u001b[81Gn\u001b[83Gw authored t\u001b[96Griff, debiting the \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mbroker's stock. Needs a tariff rule and the station's stock accounting.\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[15;1H"]
