[0.005, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[16C\u001b[10B ☒ Resupply \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Opened tote \r\u001b[2B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mA tote\u001b[11Gf oxygen \u001b[21Gs 142.5\u001b[29Gkg but the st\u001b[45Ger's tanks hold 30 kg; a tote of cartridges holds 2. What happens to the \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mrest of an opened tote?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mStays aboard (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mIt is kept as an\u001b[23Gopened tote in the hold, still taking its \u001b[66Ghole tote of space until used up (as\u001b[109Guseholds' \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bopene\u001b[12G goods are). It cannot be sold or unloaded while opened.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mReturned as whole totes\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOnly allowed when what is left \u001b[38Gounds back to\u001b[52Gwh\u001b[55Gle totes; otherwise refused. Effectively blocks oxyge\u001b[109G refills \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bf\u001b[9Gm a tote.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[16;1H"]
