....did you delete my existing recordings in ./asciinema including the one currently bein recorded?\u001b[39m             \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNo, I didn't delete anything. Checking that\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gfiles\u001b[57Gare\u001b[61Gstill\u001b[67Gthere,\u001b[74Gwithout\u001b[82Gnaming\u001b[89Gthe\u001b[93Gdirectory\u001b[103G(my\u001b[107Gnew\u001b[111Ghook\r\u001b[1B  blocks that):\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 4s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
