[0.009, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  - \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m6042438\u001b[39m is the asciinema hook. I narrowed it after it blocked committing its own file, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mguard-asciinema.sh\u001b[39m. It now\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bmatches the directory\u001b[27Gname\u001b[32Gonly\u001b[37Gwhen\u001b[42Git\u001b[45Gstands\u001b[52Galone\u001b[58Gor\u001b[61Gis\u001b[64Gfollowed\u001b[73Gby\u001b[76G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/\u001b[39m,\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83Gre-tested\u001b[93Gevery\u001b[99Gcase.\r\u001b[1B  - Side effect: the hook also blocks \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m~/asciinema\u001b[39m in your home\u001b[64Gfolder.\u001b[72GThat's\u001b[79Gharmless,\u001b[89Gsince\u001b[95Gmy\u001b[98Gcommands\u001b[107Gonly\u001b[112Grun\u001b[116Gin\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthis\u001b[10Grepo.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- The live recording stays\u001b[30Guncommitted.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mG\u001b[5Gps:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  - The trading scenario's\u001b[28Gstat\u001b[33Gons don't sell\u001b[48Goxygen \u001b[56Gr cart\u001b[63Gidges; only\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Ggover\u001b[85Gance\u001b[90Gscenario's\u001b[101Gdo. So in the\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btrading\u001b[13Gscenario\u001b[22Ga\u001b[24Gplayer\u001b[31Gcan't\u001b[37Gactually\u001b[46Gresupply\u001b[55Gyet.\u001b[60GThat's\u001b[67Gnoted\u001b[73Gfor\u001b[77GW09.\r\u001b[1B  - Still open: stations using up their own oxygen, service outages,\u001b[70Gconsequences\u001b[83Gof\u001b[86Grunning\u001b[94Gout,\u001b[99Gberth\u001b[105Gfees,\u001b[111Gand\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bexchanging\u001b[16Ga\u001b[18Gwhole\u001b[24Gtank\u001b[29Grather\u001b[36Gthan\u001b[41Grefilling\u001b[51Git.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  Nothing is\u001b[14Gpushed. Next is W07 (live and stale market\u001b[57Gobservations).\u001b[72GIt\u001b[75Gdoesn't\u001b[83Gdepend\u001b[90Gon\u001b[93Gthis\u001b[98Gdiscussion,\u001b[110Gso\u001b[113GI'd\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bstart a fresh session with\u001b[30G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/clear\u001b[39m;\u001b[38Gthe handoff is\u001b[53Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/session-handoff.md\u001b[39m.\u001b[81G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 19m 22s · done 5:11 pm\u001b[37G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mI am seeing a lot of '(file diff unavailable for this command; 1 file changed)' output after each tool call. Is this \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mbecause the new experimental 'code mode' feature is suppressing that output?\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mS\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mautéing… \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0003 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
