asciinema/jettison-0003.cast\u001b[72G\u001b[39mis your live r\u001b[87Gcor\u001b[91Ging and grows the whole\u001b[116Gime.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo nearly \u001b[14Gvery\u001b[19Gcomm\u001b[25Gd finds \"1 file changed\", even when my command\u001b[72Gchanged\u001b[80Gnothing.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7G\"diff\u001b[13Gunavailable\"\u001b[26Gpart\u001b[31Gmay\u001b[35Gbe\u001b[38Gbecause\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gfeature's\u001b[60Gown\u001b[64Gscratch\u001b[72Gdirectory,\u001b[83G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/tmp/claude-1000/bash-edit-diff\u001b[39m,\u001b[116Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bblocked by this session's sandbox.\u001b[38GIt's on\u001b[46Gboth its \u001b[57Gad\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Gwrite deny lists, so it can tell that a file changed but\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan't build the\u001b[19Gdiff. That o\u001b[32Ge is also a guess.\u001b[51G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTo\u001b[6Gcheck:\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gcount\u001b[23Gshould\u001b[30Gbe\u001b[33G1\u001b[35Geven\u001b[40Gafter\u001b[46Ga\u001b[48Gcommand\u001b[56Gthat\u001b[61Gwrites\u001b[68Gnothing,\u001b[77Gsuch\u001b[82Gas\u001b[85G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgit status\u001b[39m.\u001b[97GIt\u001b[100Gshould\u001b[107Grise\u001b[112Gabove\u001b[118G1\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.150, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 19m 22s · done 5:11 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mI am seeing a lot of '(file diff unavailable for this command; 1 file changed)' output after each tool call. Is this \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mbecause the new experimental 'code mode' feature is suppressing that output?\u001b[39m                                          \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Probably not code mode, though I can't confirm it: that line goes to your terminal, not into my tool results, so I've\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnever\u001b[9Gseen\u001b[14Git.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BMy best guess is\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24GBash\u001b[29Gtool's\u001b[36Gedit-diff\u001b[46Gfeature.\u001b[55GAfter\u001b[61Geach\u001b[66Gshell\u001b[72Gcommand,\u001b[81GClaude\u001b[88GCode\u001b[93Gchecks\u001b[100Gwhich\u001b[106Gfiles\u001b[112Gin\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brepo\u001b[8Gchanged\u001b[16Gso\u001b[19Git\u001b[22Gcan\u001b[26Gshow\u001b[31Gyou\u001b[35Ga\u001b[37Gdiff.\u001b[43G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249masciinema/jettison-0003.cast\u001b[72G\u001b[39mis\u001b[75Gyour\u001b[80Glive\u001b[85Grecording\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Ggrows\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gwhole\u001b[115Gtime.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo\u001b[6Gn\u001b[8Garly \u001b[14Gvery command finds \"1\u001b[36Gfile changed\", even wh\u001b[59Gn\u001b[61Gmy command\u001b[73Ghange\u001b[79G nothing.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe \"diff\u001b[13Gunavailable\" part may be b\u001b[40Gcause the f\u001b[52Gature's own\u001b[64Gscratch\u001b[72Gdirectory, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/tmp/claude-1000/bash-edit-diff\u001b[39m,\u001b[116Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bblocked\u001b[11Gby\u001b[14Gthis\u001b[19Gsession's\u001b[29Gsandbox.\u001b[38GIt's\u001b[43Gon\u001b[46Gboth\u001b[51Gits\u001b[55Gread\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Gwrite\u001b[70Gdeny\u001b[75Glists,\u001b[82Gso\u001b[85Git\u001b[88Gcan\u001b[92Gtell\u001b[97Gthat\u001b[102Ga\u001b[104Gfile\u001b[109Gchanged\u001b[117Gbut\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan't build the diff. Th\u001b[28Gt one is also a guess.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTo check: the count should\u001b[30Gbe 1 even after a command\u001b[56Gthat\u001b[61Gwrites\u001b[68Gnothing,\u001b[77Gsuch\u001b[82Gas\u001b[85G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgit status\u001b[39m.\u001b[97GIt\u001b[100Gshould\u001b[107Grise\u001b[112Gabove\u001b[118G1\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonly\u001b[8Gwhen\u001b[13Gone\u001b[17Gof\u001b[20Gmy\u001b[23Gcommands\u001b[32Gactually\u001b[41Gedits\u001b[47Gfiles.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
