on's sandbox.\u001b[38GIt's on\u001b[46Gboth its \u001b[57Gad\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Gwrite deny lists, so it can tell that a file changed but\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan't build the\u001b[19Gdiff. That o\u001b[32Ge is also a guess.\u001b[51G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTo\u001b[6Gcheck:\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gcount\u001b[23Gshould\u001b[30Gbe\u001b[33G1\u001b[35Geven\u001b[40Gafter\u001b[46Ga\u001b[48Gcommand\u001b[56Gthat\u001b[61Gwrites\u001b[68Gnothing,\u001b[77Gsuch\u001b[82Gas\u001b[85G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgit status\u001b[39m.\u001b[97GIt\u001b[100Gshould\u001b[107Grise\u001b[112Gabove\u001b[118G1\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonly when\u001b[13Gon\u001b[17Gof my\u001b[23Gcommands actually edits files.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf\u001b[6Git's\u001b[11Gnoise,\u001b[18Gyou\u001b[22Gcan\u001b[26Gturn\u001b[31Git\u001b[34Goff\u001b[38Gwith\u001b[43G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\"bashEditDiffEnabled\": false\u001b[72G\u001b[39min\u001b[75G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.claude/settings.local.json\u001b[103G\u001b[39m(personal)\u001b[114Gor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.claude/settings.json\u001b[39m (shared). The cost is that you'd lose diffs for real edits I make through the\u001b[103Gsh\u001b[106Gll. Edits\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.277, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Probably not code mode, though I can't confirm it: that line goes to your terminal, not into my tool results, so I've\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  never seen it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GMy \u001b[7Gest guess is the Bash tool's\u001b[36Gedit-diff feature. Af\u001b[58Ger each shell\u001b[72Gc\u001b[74Gmmand, Cl\u001b[84Gude Code checks which fi\u001b[109Ge\u001b[111G in the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Br\u001b[5Gpo changed so\u001b[19Git\u001b[22Gcan\u001b[26Gshow\u001b[31Gyou\u001b[35Ga\u001b[37Gdiff.\u001b[43G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249masciinema/jettison-0003.cast\u001b[72G\u001b[39mis\u001b[75Gyour\u001b[80Glive\u001b[85Grecording\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Ggrows\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gwhole\u001b[115Gtime.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo\u001b[6Gnearly\u001b[13Gevery\u001b[19Gcommand\u001b[27Gfinds\u001b[33G\"1\u001b[36Gfile\u001b[41Gchanged\",\u001b[51Geven\u001b[56Gwhen\u001b[61Gmy\u001b[64Gcommand\u001b[72Gchanged\u001b[80Gnothing.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe \"diff unavailable\"\u001b[26Gpart\u001b[31Gmay\u001b[35Gbe because the feature's own scratch\u001b[72Gdirectory, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/tmp/claude-1000/bash-edit-diff\u001b[39m, \u001b[117Gs\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bblocked by this\u001b[19Gsession's sandbox. It's o\u001b[45G both\u001b[51Gits read and\u001b[64Gwrite \u001b[71Geny lists, so it can\u001b[92Gtell\u001b[97Gthat\u001b[102Ga\u001b[104Gfile\u001b[109Gchanged\u001b[117Gbut\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan't\u001b[9Gbuild\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Gdiff.\u001b[25GThat\u001b[30Gone\u001b[34Gis\u001b[37Galso\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Gguess.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTo \u001b[7Gh\u001b[9Gck: the count should be 1 even after\u001b[46Ga command that writes nothing, \u001b[78Guch\u001b[82Gas\u001b[85G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgit status\u001b[39m.\u001b[97GIt should rise above 1\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonly when one of my comm\u001b[28Gnds actual\u001b[39Gy edits files.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BIf\u001b[6Git's nois\u001b[16G, you can turn it off with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\"bashEditDiffEnabled\": false\u001b[39m \u001b[74G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.claude/settings.local.json\u001b[39m (personal) \u001b[115Gr\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.claude/settings.json\u001b[39m (shared). The cost i\u001b[47Gthat you'd\u001b[58Glose\u001b[63Gdiffs\u001b[69Gfor\u001b[73Greal\u001b[78Gedits\u001b[84GI\u001b[86Gmake\u001b[91Gthrough\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gshell.\u001b[110GEdits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthrough\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15GEdit\u001b[20Gand\u001b[24GWrite\u001b[30Gtools\u001b[36Gstill\u001b[42Gshow\u001b[47Gtheir\u001b[53Gdiffs.\u001b[60GWant\u001b[65Gme\u001b[68Gto\u001b[71Gadd\u001b[75Git?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GSautéing… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(13s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m807 tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
