Gn\u001b[49Gorder.\u001b[56GNeither go\u001b[67Gs\u001b[69Gbelow\u001b[75Gzero. Running out has no effect yet.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mResupply:\u001b[22m two new player commands, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mRefill\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mReplace\u001b[39m, take \u001b[66Gxygen and cartridges fr\u001b[90Gm t\u001b[94Ge ship's own\u001b[107Ghold,\u001b[113Gso\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gplayer buys them through\u001b[30Gthe market and lo\u001b[48Gds\u001b[51Gthem firs\u001b[61G. They work anywhere. An opened tote stays i\u001b[107Gthe hold,\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btaking\u001b[12Ga tote of\u001b[22Gspace, until it is\u001b[41Gused up, and can't be\u001b[63Gunloaded.\u001b[73GA replaced cartridge is thrown\u001b[104Gaway.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mOne-time grant:\u001b[22m the starter sh\u001b[36Gp\u001b[38Ggets full tanks\u001b[54Gand a\u001b[60Gfresh c\u001b[68Grtridge once, at p\u001b[87Gov\u001b[90Gsion\u001b[95Gng. D\u001b[101Gcking, reconnecting,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gretrying or loading\u001b[25Ga sav\u001b[31G never\u001b[38Gr\u001b[40Gfills them.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPlayers can see it:\u001b[25G\u001b[22mthe play\u001b[34Gr's\u001b[38Gview now includes\u001b[56Geach\u001b[61Gship's\u001b[68Goxygen,\u001b[76Gcartridges\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Gconnection,\u001b[103Gand\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111Gconsole\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ghas \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mservice refill|replace\u001b[39m. Because the view changed, the network proto\u001b[77Gol version went from 2 to 3. One pin\u001b[114Ged save\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bh in the company tests mov\u001b[35Gd, b\u001b[40Gcause saves now hold the new life-support data.\u001b[88G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mJettison:\u001b[22m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
