[38GIt's on\u001b[46Gboth its \u001b[57Gad\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Gwrite deny lists, so it can tell that a file changed but\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan't build the\u001b[19Gdiff. That o\u001b[32Ge is also a guess.\u001b[51G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTo\u001b[6Gcheck:\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gcount\u001b[23Gshould\u001b[30Gbe\u001b[33G1\u001b[35Geven\u001b[40Gafter\u001b[46Ga\u001b[48Gcommand\u001b[56Gthat\u001b[61Gwrites\u001b[68Gnothing,\u001b[77Gsuch\u001b[82Gas\u001b[85G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgit status\u001b[39m.\u001b[97GIt\u001b[100Gshould\u001b[107Grise\u001b[112Gabove\u001b[118G1\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonly when\u001b[13Gon\u001b[17Gof my\u001b[23Gcommands actually edits files.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf\u001b[6Git's\u001b[11Gnoise,\u001b[18Gyou\u001b[22Gcan\u001b[26Gturn\u001b[31Git\u001b[34Goff\u001b[38Gwith\u001b[43G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\"bashEditDiffEnabled\": false\u001b[72G\u001b[39min\u001b[75G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.claude/settings.local.json\u001b[103G\u001b[39m(personal)\u001b[114Gor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.claude/settings.json\u001b[39m (shared). The cost is that you'd lose diffs for real edits I make through the\u001b[103Gsh\u001b[106Gll. Edits\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthrough the Edit and Write tools still show\u001b[76Gt?\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
