[3.981, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[17B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯ /update-config              Change settings: hooks, permissions, environment variables\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  /ponytail:ponytail-audit    (ponytail) Quality audit of a whole repo: bugs, security holes, what breaks under real\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G                             \u001b[33G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mload, risky code without tests, slow paths, and what to delete, merge or split. Ranke…\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  /statusline                 Set up the status line\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[39m/\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;4H\u001b[?25h"]
